OL,3,ATrump calls off livestream for Fort
OL,4,AHood shooter's execution by firing
OL,5,Asquad
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has called
OL,8,Foff plans to livestream the execution
OL,9,Fof former US army psychiatrist Nidal
OL,10,FHasan by firing squad.
OL,12,FTrump had previously said he approved
OL,13,Fof showing online the death of the Fort
OL,14,FHood attacker, while Vice-President JD
OL,15,FVance cast doubt on whether it would
OL,16,Fhappen and said he would not watch it.
OL,18,FAs criticism over the public display
OL,19,Fmounted, Trump said on Thursday that
OL,20,F"many very good and well meaning people
OL,21,Fwould rather not watch him die".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
