OL,5,Asquad
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I think streaming the execution for
OL,8,Fall to see might have been a strong
OL,9,Fdeterrent for the World to witness how
OL,10,FAmerica deals with Terrorists and SCUM
OL,11,Flike Hasan," Trump said.
